= Abstract

#set text(lang: "en", region: "US")

This should be a 1-page (maximum) summary of your work in English.

The English abstract should convey the same content as the German Kurzfassung.
Try to translate it precisely without translating word for word. Note that certain
German expressions have no equivalent in English or must be phrased entirely
differently, and that sentence structure in English differs significantly from German.

Even with full confidence in your English skills, it is always advisable to have
a native speaker proofread the text.

The correct translation of "Diplomarbeit" is _thesis_ or at most "diploma thesis" —
never "diploma work" or "dissertation".
